{
  "version": 1,
  "comment": "Object-driven impostor catalog (Cycle 50). Drives the offline impostor bake (tools/bake-tree-impostors.mjs) and, from Phase 3, the runtime impostor route (js/world/objectImpostorManifest.js). Replaces the hardcoded tree list: adding an object or an impostor variant is a manifest edit plus a bake, not a code edit. impostor.enabled gates which objects bake; layouts/variants drive the bake matrix. layoutPresets centralize the Kiln CLI knobs.",
